I definitions.inc

> init
<<<
+ test1.txt test1.txt
+ test2.txt test2.txt
+ test3.txt test3.txt

> add test1.txt
<<<
> add test2.txt
<<<

# --- 场景 1：暂存区有文件时 ---
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===
test1.txt
test2.txt

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===
test3.txt

<<<

> commit "This is test"
<<<

# --- 场景 2：提交后，Staged 栏必须变空 ---
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===
test3.txt

<<<

> rm test1.txt
<<<

# --- 场景 3：执行 rm 后，文件出现在 Removed Files ---
# 注意：此时不带 (deleted) 后缀，因为你是用命令删的
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===
test1.txt

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===
test3.txt

<<<

> commit "This is test2"
<<<

# --- 场景 4：提交“删除”后，Removed 栏变空 ---
# 此时 test1.txt 已经彻底不在这个分支里了
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===
test3.txt

<<<

# 修改 test2.txt 的内容（用 test3 的内容覆盖它）
+ test2.txt test3.txt

# --- 场景 5：手动修改但没 add，出现在 Modifications 栏 ---
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===
test2.txt (modified)

=== Untracked Files ===
test3.txt

<<<

> add test2.txt
<<<
> add test3.txt
<<<
> commit "This is test3"
<<<

# 手动删除 test2 和 test3 (不使用 rm 命令)
- test2.txt
- test3.txt

# --- 场景 6：手动删除文件，出现在 Modifications (deleted) ---
> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===
test2.txt (deleted)
test3.txt (deleted)

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<

# 此时运行 rm 才会真正把它们放进 Removed Files
> rm test2.txt
<<<
> rm test3.txt
<<<

> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===
test2.txt
test3.txt

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<

> commit "This is test4"
<<<

> status
=== Branches ===
*master

=== Staged Files ===

=== Removed Files ===

=== Modifications Not Staged For Commit ===

=== Untracked Files ===

<<<